{"id":167001117456347,"type":"artist","name":"New Model Army","artist":null,"year":1980,"weight":11,"info":{"tags":["post-punk","alternative","rock","punk","indie"],"country":"GB","begin":"1980","kind":"Group","similar":["Spear of Destiny","Half Man Half Biscuit","Killing Joke","Phillip Boa & the Voodooclub","Carter the Unstoppable Sex Machine","Julian Cope","Therapy?","Public Image Ltd.","The Wedding Present","The Cult"],"disambiguation":"80s punk/goth rock","img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/New_Model_Army%2C_3-Maj%C3%B3wka_2023_23.jpg?width=500","bio":"New Model Army tomaron el nombre prestado del Ejercito Revolucionario Ingles de Oliver Cromwell (1645)y desde 1980  han evolucionado y han tocado multitud de estilos, desde el post punk al indie rock o desde el gotic rock al Folk, un grupo nacido para crear música con mayúsculas y llenarla de mensajes tan humanitarios como poéticos.No hacen canciones, sino himnos, a base de post-punk, gothic-rock y folk-rock. Una mezcla explosiva que deriva en “The Hunt”"},"works":[{"id":243085971086130,"type":"album","name":"Vengeance","artist":"New Model Army","year":1984,"weight":9,"yt":"GOzY0k0g3c8","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":52032266791182,"name":"Scaruffi 1980s","rank":595,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":188909847204755,"type":"album","name":"Vengenace","artist":"New Model Army","year":1984,"weight":6,"yt":"GOzY0k0g3c8","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":155094981156997,"type":"album","name":"The Ghost of Cain","artist":"New Model Army","year":1986,"weight":3,"yt":"O0roz7mTQxs","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":182218712006755,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Post-Punk","rank":195,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":8472114652660,"type":"album","name":"Impurity","artist":"New Model Army","year":1990,"weight"