man y los Saints. La segunda ola (GBH, UK Subs, Neurotics, New Model Army, Stiff Little Fingers) y el punk anarquista (Crass, Discharge, Rudimentari Peni, Subhumans).","color":"#fb7185","family":"Punk, new wave, hardcore y noise","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#punk-uk"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":188909847204755,"artist":"New Model Army","artist_id":167001117456347,"title":"Vengenace","year":1984,"ess":0,"yt":"GOzY0k0g3c8","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Punk-rock británico","scene_id":8050879847229,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#punk-uk","chapters":["Sección 5.2"],"pages":[[1,122,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":122,"text":"…British version of the Dead Kennedys, UK Subs, Neurotics (1), whose Beggars Can Be Choosers (1983) still embodied the spirit of 1977, Nihilistics, New Model Army (1), whose Vengenace (1984) was one of the best political albums of the age, and, in Ireland, the great Stiff Little Fingers (1), whose furious,…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":243085971086130,"type":"album","name":"Vengeance","list_id":52032266791182,"list":"Scaruffi 1980s","src":"musthear","rank":595,"year":1984,"note":null,"yt":"GOzY0k0g3c8","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":155094981156997,"type":"album","name":"The Ghost of Cain","list_id":182218712006755,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Post-Punk","src":"musthear","rank":195,"year":1986,"note":null,"yt":"O0roz7mTQxs","scaruffi":null},{"id":8472114652660,"type":"album","name":"Impurity","work_year":1990,"list_id":90391435651867,"list":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1990","src":"charts","rank":102,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"Zf9vkPcH708","scaruffi":null},{"id":97569738763845,"type":"album","name":"The Love of Hopeless Causes","work_year":1993,"list_id":59251635065665,"list":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1993",